WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:10.080
Today, Joe Biden will be announcing multiple&nbsp;
executive actions on guns on firearm safety.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.800
It may already have happened by the time you&nbsp;
listen to today's show or watch today's clips.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:22.000
This is already angering many people. But it has&nbsp;
to happen because we have a gun violence crisis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.360
in this country. We have a gun culture crisis&nbsp;
in this country. One of the actions Joe Biden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:34.080
is expected to take is to deal with what are&nbsp;
called ghost guns, guns without serial numbers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:39.920
sometimes which can be made at home. Biden&nbsp;
is expected to direct the administration to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:46.640
start a process that will require buyers of&nbsp;
so-called ghost guns to undergo background&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:54.160
checks. A question remains about exactly what&nbsp;
Joe Biden is going to do. And again, but by now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:59.920
meaning when you're listening to today's show, we&nbsp;
may already know a Biden previously called on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:05.600
Senate to pass stricter background check rules.&nbsp;
The House has already passed them. These would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:11.040
make background checks apply to every gun sale&nbsp;
and transfer. It would give the FBI more time to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:16.080
conduct background checks. Whether something&nbsp;
related to that will be part of the orders,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:24.400
we just don't know yet. Joe Biden might announce&nbsp;
some regulations on concealed and or assault style&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:31.520
firearms, maybe prohibitions on firearm purchases&nbsp;
for those convicted of domestic violence against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:37.920
partners. Maybe something about alerting law&nbsp;
enforcement agencies when potential buyers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:42.640
fail background checks that these are people you&nbsp;
may want to keep an eye on as they may try to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:48.480
obtain a firearm some other way, potentially&nbsp;
federal guidance on home storage safety&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:53.280
measures. There's a whole bunch of possibilities&nbsp;
and we'll know them very soon if we don't already.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.280 --> 00:02:00.080
But what we can be absolutely certain of is&nbsp;
that a huge portion of the American right wing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:05.360
will be against whatever Joe Biden announces.&nbsp;
They will say all the things that they always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:11.280
say. And to prepare you for that, we need to not&nbsp;
lose sight of the big picture. Whatever Joe Biden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:17.280
announces or announced today changes nothing about&nbsp;
the Second Amendment. We have a Second Amendment.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:23.200
People have a right to own firearms. None&nbsp;
of Joe Biden's orders will change that. Joe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:30.960
Biden essentially has no choice but to do this.&nbsp;
And why think back to the Sandy Hook shooting.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:38.160
When Democrats had the White House under Barack&nbsp;
Obama, the House of Representatives, the Senate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:46.960
and nearly 90 percent of Americans supported&nbsp;
a law for universal background checks. Such a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:52.480
milquetoast thing, such a basic thing, Democrats&nbsp;
still couldn't get it done because of opposition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:58.880
from Republicans, because of opposition from the&nbsp;
gun lobby. If you can't get universal background&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:04.720
checks done in that environment after one of&nbsp;
the worst school shootings in American history,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:09.680
controlling the White House, House and Senate and&nbsp;
having the American public on your side at an 88&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:14.960
to 90 percent level, which is almost unheard of in&nbsp;
the hyper partizan American political status quo.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:19.680
I don't know that you can ever really get&nbsp;
anything done unless a president just says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:24.800
I'm doing executive action. So this has to&nbsp;
happen. They will say Biden is coming for your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:31.680
guns. They will say Biden is ending the Second&nbsp;
Amendment. None of it is true. But let's see what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:36.560
Joe Biden does or did if it already happened,&nbsp;
depending on when you listen to today's show.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:40.640
And then we will talk more about the implications&nbsp;
of what he does, what he does. But it has to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:46.080
be done. There's no other choice. You know, you&nbsp;
hear from the right, some on the right say, well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:52.720
we should work together. The left, the Democratic&nbsp;
Party shouldn't act unilaterally. What choice do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:58.720
they have when 90 percent of the country wants&nbsp;
background checks and Republicans still don't? So&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:04.400
once we know exactly what Joe Biden signs, we&nbsp;
will have more on this on The David Pakman Show&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:10.320
Instagram page. Make sure you are following us&nbsp;
there at The David Pakman Show on Instagram.

